== Effects ==
* Adds a {{dlc|nr+}} 15% / {{dlc|r+}} 33% chance to gain the {{i|Skatole}} effect in each room. This chance is seeded into the room and isn't affected by [[Luck]].
* {{dlc|r+}} Spawns a blue fly when entering a new combat room.

== Notes ==
* For a list of what flies are affected and how, see the {{I|Skatole}} page.
* Dropping the trinket will not revert {{E|Fly|text=Flies}}, but will undo the other benefits.

== Synergies ==
* {{a|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either spawns a second blue fly when entering a new combat room. Having both spawns a total of 3 blue flies.

